Third-party data in datasets/columns_524k/
==========================================

Each file holds the first 524,288 values of one column, one value per line, xz-compressed. The MIT licence of
this repository does NOT apply to the files below that derive from third-party data; each keeps the licence of
its source. Derivations are described in datasets/README.md.

h3_r9, h3_r15, s2_l16, s2_l30, morton_2x16, morton_2x32
  Derived from OpenStreetMap data (Geofabrik extract great-britain-latest.osm.pbf, downloaded 2026-08-25).
  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors. These files are a Derived Database made available under the Open Database
  License (ODbL) 1.0, https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/ . They are not MIT-licensed: any public
  use must attribute OpenStreetMap, and redistributed adaptations must stay under the ODbL (share-alike).

ipv4_id
  IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com), "IP to City Lite", obtained via the ip-location-db project
  (dbip-city-ipv4.csv). Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
  Modified: start and end address of each range as uint32, concatenated and shuffled.

snowflake
  Baseline Twitter Timelines (Tweet IDs), Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.7717006. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  Modified: first TSV column as uint64, first 524,288 rows in file order.

F1_stocks_usa
  "Financial data set used in INFORE project", Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.3886895, obtained via the ALP
  reproducibility archive. Licensed under CC BY 4.0. Modified: first 524,288 doubles printed as %.17g.

F2_food_prices
  WFP Food Prices (World Food Programme), Humanitarian Data Exchange dataset wfp-food-prices.
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution for Intergovernmental Organisations (CC BY-IGO).
  Modified: field mp_price, first 524,288 non-empty values.

quadkey
  High Resolution Settlement Layer crowd labels, facebookresearch/HighResolutionSettlementLayer
  (data/labels.csv.gz), released under the MIT License (see the LICENSE file of that repository, whose
  copyright notice applies to this file).
  Modified: zoom-15 quadkey strings converted to integers, file order.

inat_species_id
  Species keys of iNaturalist Open Data observations aligned to the GBIF backbone taxonomy, via the Hugging Face
  dataset juppy44/gbif-plants-raw (tagged MIT). Credit: iNaturalist (https://www.inaturalist.org) and GBIF
  (https://www.gbif.org). Modified: species_id, nulls dropped.

publicbi_npi
  US National Provider Identifiers (CMS NPPES, a public US government record), as included in the Public BI
  Benchmark workbook Medicare1. Only this public-record column is redistributed; no other Public BI column is.

uuidv7_hi, uuidv7_lo, xmark
  Generated by us (UUIDv7 per RFC 9562; XMark with xmlgen -f 10.0); covered by this repository's licence.

Not redistributed (download instructions in datasets/README.md): Instagram (Kaggle, licence unknown), all other
Public BI Benchmark columns (no data licence stated), TPC-H (TPC generator licence), the Kaggle float columns
(City-Temp, POI-lat) and the NEON float columns (Air-Pressure, Dew-Point-Temp).
